@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` classifies a message containing the exact lowercase substring `refund` as `refund-review`. It classifies every other message as `invoice-question`.
+
+These labels categorize refund and invoice questions; they do not establish a refund decision, invoice status, or account-specific facts.

